<title>Japan: INSIGHT -JGBs seen stuck in range around 124.50.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT -JGBs seen stuck in range around 124.50.</headline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>FUTURE RANGE/DAY   SPPRT    RSTNC    RSI-9   MA-5     MA-25</p>
<p>JGB  124.20-124.70 124.00   124.80   63pct   124.08   123.47</p>
<p>OUTLOOK FOR BOJ OPERATION AT 0020 GMT: Drainage of 200 bln yen</p>
<p>-------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 3------------------</p>
<p>*Key September 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB)</p>
<p>futures likely to move within recent range at around 124.50 on</p>
<p>Thursday. No impact seen from U.S. interest rates being left</p>
<p>unchanged at FOMC meeting overnight.</p>
<p>*Downside room seen narrowing as investors' cash bond</p>
<p>buying detected above 124.00.</p>
